              "text": "Extract the facts from this evidence item."
            },
            {
              "type": "input_text",
              "text": "<evidence id=\"E1\" sha256=\"cef33e45cc6c706c0e93e0c7db7da395b6d0d0a8ceb218eea9c60dfe98a0def5\" kind=\"text\" label=\"shipment evidence\">\nIndia Post\nBooking date: 10 April 2025\nSender: Kavya, India\nRecipient: Mira, France\n\nContents: two brass lotus candle holders\nService: international tracked parcel\nTracking number: EE482731695IN\nParcel count: 1\nPostage paid by sender: EUR 16 equivalent\n\nThe parcel was accepted at the counter on the booking date shown above. Tracking updates may take time to appear after acceptance. The sender should retain this receipt and provide the tracking number to the recipient. Delivery details were supplied at the counter and are not reproduced on this customer copy.\n</evidence>"
            }
          ]
